<title>UK: Bank of England allots 215 mln stg in repos.</title>
<headline>Bank of England allots 215 mln stg in repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 215 million stg of assistance in the form of 6.25 percent repos to May 27 and 28.</p>
</text>
